  id: base.quest.09
  number: 9
  title: Race Against Time
  previousQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 35e48ed09138c9842926e2c836bbe1f9, type: 2}
  parchmentText: A guide has led you into an underground maze that is rumored to
    hold a great secret. He has led you down many dark corridors and finally you
    find yourself in a room with three doors. Suddenly the guide puts out his torch
    and in darkness you hear him laugh. 'Farewell, my heroes,' he taunts as he makes
    his escape. You realize to your horror that it is a trap! You must escape (make
    it back to the stairway) or perish in this dark, forgotten hole.
